  "description": "Load it up! The BOGAN ST1 is designed in collaboration with riders from the bikepacking community, the new BOGAN ST1 features a unique Tange Champion frame in a Pigeon / Blue colourway with a flattened top tube for extra comfort. Equipped with 2x Shimano GRX components specifically designed for serious exploration on rough roads. This bike allows you to go the distance, with Rondo Dirt Drop handlebars shaped for comfort with soft bar tape, a WTB Volt saddle, and a Rondo LIT wheelset that accepts up to 29X2.1 tyres. A unique lift handle makes a loaded bike easier to carry. Water bottle mounts are placed inside the frame for maximum volume, with attachment points on the fork, top tube, down tube, and rear triangle to fit any rack on the market. This is the ultimate off-road explorer.\"",
